  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> be the numbers of real roots of the quadratic equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> respectively, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></math> denotes the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now from above equation we say that, it could have its solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;but it does not exist&nbsp;as at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;LHS<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,</p><p>So no solution, hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Taking Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now taking Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;solution i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
